{:edb/committed true :edb/basis-t 235 :edb/replayed false :edb/tx-hash "3f33631c7d51648791a8f546b14a3e5a73bc0034fda495d94080460cb2e0cc92" :edb/db-before-t 234 :edb/db-after-t 235 :edb/tx-data [[13194139533547 50 #inst "2026-10-11T06:01:21.457Z" 13194139533547 17592186045585 true] [17592186198265 1038 #edb/ref 17592186407637 13194139533547 17592186045585 true] [17592186198266 1038 #edb/ref 17592186407635 13194139533547 17592186045585 true] [17592186198266 1038 #edb/ref 17592186407636 13194139533547 17592186045585 true] [17592186198267 1038 #edb/ref 17592186407638 13194139533547 17592186045585 true] [17592186198716 1068 #edb/ref 17592186194892 13194139533547 17592186045585 false] [17592186198716 1068 #edb/ref 17592186407631 13194139533547 17592186045585 true] [17592186198716 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045485 13194139533547 17592186045585 true] [17592186198716 1071 "$\\,$ If $x$ is divisible by $6,$ then $x$ is even.\n\nWhich of the following is logically equivalent to the conditional predicate above?" 13194139533547 17592186045585 true] [17592186198716 1071 "If $x$ is divisible by $6$, then $x$ is even.\n\nWhich of the following is logically equivalent to the conditional predicate above?" 13194139533547 17592186045585 false] [17592186198716 1074 "Let's denote by $P(x)$ and $Q(x)$ the following predicates:\n\n- $P(x):$ $x$ is divisible by $6.$\n\n- $Q(x):$ $x$ is even.\n\nThen, our initial sentence can be written as $P(x)⇒Q(x),$ which is logically equivalent to \n\n$$\n¬P(x)∨Q(x).\n$$\n\nThe negation of $P(x)$ can be written as\n\n- $¬P(x):$ $x$ is not divisible by $6.$\n\nTherefore, the given sentence is logically equivalent to the following:\n\n$\\,$ $x$ is not divisible by $6,$ or $x$ is even." 13194139533547 17592186045585 true] [17592186407604 1043 #edb/ref 17592186407639 13194139533547 17592186045585 true] [17592186407604 1043 #edb/ref 17592186407640 13194139533547 17592186045585 true] [17592186407604 1043 #edb/ref 17592186407641 13194139533547 17592186045585 true] [1